{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46884","headline":"送李秀才归湘中 · 齐己","name":"送李秀才归湘中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"词客携文访病夫，因吟送别忆湘湖。\n寒消浦溆催鸿鴈，暖入溪山养鹧鸪。\n僧向月中寻岳麓，云从城上去苍梧。\n君归爲问峰前寺，旧住僧房锁在无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}